Message for creating dependency graph json map.
Example Json:
{"build_target":{"name":"board"},"output_file":"/tmp/depgraph.json"}

Build an image.
Example json:
{
 "build_target": {"name": "reef"},
}

Test an image.
Example json:
{
 "build_target": {"name": "reef"},
 "image": {"path": "/mnt/host/source/src/build/images/reef/latest"},
 "result": {"directory": "/tmp/image_test_results"}
}

Execute SignerTest for an image.  Added in R78.
Example json:
{
 "build_target": {"name": "reef"},
 "image": {"path": "/mnt/host/source/src/build/images/reef/latest"},
 "result": {"directory": "/tmp/image_test_results"}
}

Execute PushImage for a script.  Added in R89.
Example json:
{
  "dryrun": true,
  "gs_image_dir": "gs://chromeos-image-archive/atlas-release/R89-13604.0.0",
  "sysroot": {
      "build_target": {
          "name": "atlas"
      }
  },
  "sign_types": [1, 6]
}

Chroot update request message.
Example json:
{"toolchain_targets": [{"name": "eve"}]}

